# Frontend settings. Copy to .env.local for local development.
#
# Almost everything the app needs - the area name and bounds, the emergency
# number, the report categories, the demo trip - comes from the backend on
# /health rather than living here. That is deliberate: two copies of the same
# setting drift apart, and the one in the frontend is always the stale one.

# Where the backend is. Leave this BLANK in normal use: the dev server
# forwards API calls for you, and in production the backend serves this app
# itself. Only set it if you are pointing a local frontend at a deployed
# backend.
VITE_API_BASE=
